reported in the paper.</li>\n<li>Included pinned dependency specifications in the archived package.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Framework validation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Corrected the evaluation of multiplier-based value dependencies.</li>\n<li>Ensured semantic consistency between dynamic evaluation and static absorption during preprocessing.</li>\n<li>Added regression tests covering value-dependency behaviour.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Solver integration</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed unsafe branch pruning from the Pruned Brute Force solver.</li>\n<li>Exactness is now guaranteed within the documented applicability scope (up to 22 active decision items).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated examples and replication artefacts.</li>\n<li>Improved experiment reproducibility documentation.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Isa del \u00c1guila", "affiliation": "University of Almer\u00eda"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/imaguila/NRPExperimentFramework/tree/v1.1.1", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.1.1", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/imaguila/NRPExperimentFramework"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 3, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23293766"}}]}}, "title": "imaguila/NRPExperimentFramework: NRP-Exp v1.1.1", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23664592", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23664592", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23664592?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23664592", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23664592", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23664592", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23664592/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23293766", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23293