"size": 261773, "checksum": "md5:b86c220bb5eab2a043fc9e2e15f3c077", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23615180/files/stratum-overview.png/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1674124"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 16, "unique_downloads": 13, "views": 26, "unique_views": 20, "version_downloads": 16, "version_unique_downloads": 13, "version_unique_views": 20, "version_views": 26}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-24T09:53:25.708653+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-24T09:53:25.850565+00:00", "id": 23614755, "conceptrecid": "23614754", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23614754", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "metadata": {"title": "Context Is a Pipeline, Not a Window: Information Attrition in LLM Agent Harnesses (Replication Package)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "publication_date": "2026-10-24", "description": "<p>Anonymized replication package for an ICSE 2027 NIER submission (title above), currently under double-anonymous review. Contains the code and data behind the paper, not the paper manuscript itself.</p><p>The paper measures how much of a tool-using LLM agent's output is lost before the model ever sees it, in an agent that diagnoses injected faults from Linux kernel traces. It finds that a third of all tool results were destroyed in transit by a positional (prefix-slice) cut, and runs a registered, controlled experiment to test whether that cut causes the accuracy gap it correlates with.</p><p>Layout: <code>agent/</code> is the harness under study (the LangGraph diagnosis agent and its tool-result cutting mechanism); <code>study/</code> is everything specific to this paper -- drivers, derived results, the full replay corpus of raw transcripts, the delivery-cliff figure, and the registered pre-analysis plan with its dated amendment log. See the top-level README.md for the full layout and a verified reproduction guide (which scripts run standalone with no API key or raw trace data, and which need data available on request).</p><p>Not included: the raw multi-gigabyte LTTng/CTF kernel trace capture, available on request through the venue's anonymous channel.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Anonymous", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["LLM agents", "agent harnesses", "context engineering", "tool use", "replication package", "ICSE 2027 NIER", "kernel traces", "root cause analysis"], "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23614754"}}]}, "notes": "Companion artifact for a submission currently under double-anonymous review. Data under study/ (transcripts, results, derived CSVs, kernel-trace index) is additionally released under CC BY 4.0; code under MIT. See LICENSE in the archive for details."}, "title": "Context Is a Pipeline, Not a Window: Information Attrition in LLM Agent Harnesses (Replication Package)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23614755", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23614755", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23614755?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23614755", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23614755/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23614754", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23614754", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23614754", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23614754", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23614755/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23614755/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23614755/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23614755/media